1
00:00:01,530 --> 00:00:03,070
We are team Minus Zero.

2
00:00:03,070 --> 00:00:06,260
Mission Architect: a browser game where you design

3
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:07,690
a real space mission —

4
00:00:07,690 --> 00:00:08,640
pick the Moon,

5
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:09,930
Mars or Bennu,

6
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:13,370
build your spacecraft under a real rocket equation,

7
00:00:13,370 --> 00:00:14,990
survive real events,

8
00:00:14,990 --> 00:00:17,170
and get graded on your decisions.

9
00:00:17,170 --> 00:00:18,440
Built on NASA data:

10
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:21,020
OSDR, Planetary Fact Sheets,

11
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:24,930
JPL Small-Body Database and DONKI.

12
00:00:24,930 --> 00:00:26,130
Play it live —

13
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:27,940
link on our project page.

